      <h2 class="text-[32px] font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-white">GARANSI 100%</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[320px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-blue-100/80">
        Pesan sekarang tanpa was-was, bayar saat barang sampai di tangan kurir (COD)!
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 text-left">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
          <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[#1E3A8A]">
            <Icon name="badge-check" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
          </span>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
            <strong class="mb-0.5 block text-slate-950">100% Konsentrat Original.</strong> Formula asli bersegel resmi pabrik GlowHome, bukan cairan oplosan.
