        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
          <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[#1E3A8A]">
            <Icon name="truck" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
          </span>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
            <strong class="mb-0.5 block text-slate-950">Bisa Bayar di Tempat (COD).</strong> Bayar langsung ke kurir saat paket sampai di rumah Anda.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
          <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center text-[#1E3A8A]">
            <Icon name="shield-check" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
